@{
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_SolteiraBrandsLayout.cshtml";
}

<link rel="stylesheet" href="~/Content/SolteiraBrandsStyle/FAQsStyle.css" />

<div class="faq-title">
    <span>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</span>
</div>

<div class="faq-container" id="faqAccordion">

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseOne"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseOne">
            <span class="question-text">
                All About GIA Grading
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseOne" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    A GIA Diamond is a diamond certified by the Gemological Institute of America,
                    the World's foremost authority in independent third-party diamond certification.
                    GIA diamonds are examined by a minimum of four highly trained diamond graders and
                    gemologists. At each step of a diamond's evaluation, a more senior staff member
                    independently grades the stone.
                </p>
                <p>
                    The GIA Diamond Grading Report is issued for diamonds that fall in the D-Z color range.
                    This detailed report includes a full quality analysis of shape and cutting style,
                    measurements, carat weight, color grade, clarity grade, cut grade (for brilliant
                    round-cut diamonds), polish and symmetry assessments, and fluorescence. The report also
                    includes a plotted diagram indicating the relative size and location of clarity characteristics,
                    a proportion diagram, and GIA grading scales.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwo"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwo">
            <span class="question-text">
                Are your jewelry real?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseTwo" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    The items offered are 100% genuine and authentic. These are natural, earth-mined diamonds,
                    not man-made. The jewelry pieces feature high-quality Hong Kong and Japan settings, and all
                    are crafted from authentic 14K, 18K, and 24K gold.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseThree"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseThree">
            <span class="question-text">
                Does your jewelry have a certificate?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseThree" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    Authenticity is provided via supplier-issued certificates of authenticity for the diamonds used,
                    rather than individual jewelry certifications at purchase. While full diamond certification is
                    purposefully done through the GIA or local appraisers, this process notably increases the final cost.
                    Therefore, any desired certification is at the client's expense. A guaranteed money-back refund is
                    offered if the jewelry pieces acquired are subsequently proven counterfeit.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFour"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFour">
            <span class="question-text">
                What are the payment options?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseFour" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    We accept Full Payment or Layaway. Payment can be made via GCash, Bank Transfer, or Cash
                    (available for Full Payment only at agreed-upon meetups).
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseFive"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseFive">
            <span class="question-text">
                What are the Layaway terms?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseFive" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    To secure your item, a 30% non-refundable down payment is required. Following this, you
                    must adhere to the agreed-upon monthly payment schedule. Failure to comply with this
                    schedule or complete the full balance by the final due date will result in the automatic
                    cancellation of the layaway agreement. Please note that all payments made up to the point
                    of cancellation will be forfeited by the seller to compensate for the cost of holding the item,
                    and the jewelry will be returned to inventory for resale.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSix"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSix">
            <span class="question-text">
                When do I receive payment details?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseSix" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    Payment details are sent via email only to confirmed buyers.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseSeven"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseSeven">
            <span class="question-text">
                Is domestic shipping free?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseSeven" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    Yes, free, insured, and secured nationwide delivery is offered via LBC.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseEight"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseEight">
            <span class="question-text">
                When will my order be shipped?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseEight" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    Orders paid for today will be shipped on the following business day. Please note
                    that delivery occurs on weekdays only.
                </p>
