                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>North & South Luzon</td>
                            <td>4-6 days</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Visayas & Mindanao</td>
                            <td>10-14 days</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTen"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTen">
            <span class="question-text">
                Do you offer international shipping?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseTen" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    Yes, international shipping is available via FedEx/DHL. The client is responsible
                    for paying the international shipment and insurance fees.
                </p>
                <p style="font-weight: bold">
                    Note on Shipping Delays:
                </p>
                <p>
                    All shipping may be subject to delays due to unforeseen circumstances outside the
                    company's scope, which may affect the estimated delivery time.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseEleven"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseEleven">
            <span class="question-text">
                What is your return and exchange policy?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseEleven" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    Solteira & Brands enforces a no return, no exchange policy for all items.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="faq-item">

        <div class="faq-header" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapseTwelve"
             aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseTwelve">
            <span class="question-text">
                Are there any exceptions to the no return, no exchange policy?
            </span>
            <span class="icon-wrapper">
                <i class="bi bi-plus-lg icon-plus"></i>
                <i class="bi bi-dash-lg icon-minus"></i>
            </span>
        </div>

        <div class="collapse" id="collapseTwelve" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
            <div class="content">
                <p>
                    The only exception is for items that are verified as fake.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>


</div>